1
00:00:37,198 --> 00:00:42,648
ONBOARDING ASSISTANT: Recording. Pilot zero one two one. Last Approach.

2
00:00:42,718 --> 00:00:44,728
ONBOARDING ASSISTANT: Weapon status: cold.

3
00:00:44,791 --> 00:00:47,921
LANE AUTHORITY BRIEFING: For three hundred years it has held the lanes shut.

4
00:00:48,071 --> 00:00:51,121
LANE AUTHORITY BRIEFING: One hundred and twenty-one pilots have flown against it.

5
00:00:51,191 --> 00:00:52,481
LANE AUTHORITY BRIEFING: None came back.

6
00:00:54,822 --> 00:00:56,672
THE WARDEN: STOP! Stop right there!

7
00:00:56,742 --> 00:01:00,192
THE WARDEN: Do you have ANY idea how long it takes to grow a scout?!

8
00:01:01,510 --> 00:01:04,160
ONBOARDING ASSISTANT: That is not the voice from the briefing.

9
00:01:12,795 --> 00:01:16,165
THE WARDEN: They don't want the lanes open! They want them OWNED!

10
00:01:19,065 --> 00:01:24,995
THE WARDEN: Wait. Wait, wait, wait. Your gun is cold. Why is your gun cold?!
